<section id="A9" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix I </span>Forward chaining experiment</h2>

<section id="A9.SS1" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">I.1 </span>Forward chaining pseudocode</h3>

<figure id="algorithm2" class="ltx_float ltx_algorithm ltx_framed ltx_framed_top">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_float"><span id="algorithm2.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Algorithm 2</span> </span>Forward Chaining</figcaption>
<div id="algorithm2.4" class="ltx_listing ltx_lst_numbers_left ltx_framed ltx_framed_topbottom ltx_listing">
<div id="algorithm2.4.1" class="ltx_listingline">
<span id="algorithm2.4.1.1" class="ltx_text"><span id="algorithm2.4.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Input:</span> </span><math id="algorithm2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="V" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>V</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">V</annotation></semantics></math>: top-<math id="algorithm2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>k</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k</annotation></semantics></math> vocab projections at each latent token position and the answer positions
</div>
<div id="algorithm2.4.2" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="algorithm2.4.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_phantom"><span style="visibility:hidden"><span id="algorithm2.4.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Input:</span> </span></span><math id="algorithm2.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="Q" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>Q</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">Q</annotation></semantics></math>: numbers extracted from the question
</div>
<div id="algorithm2.4.3" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="algorithm2.4.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_phantom"><span style="visibility:hidden"><span id="algorithm2.4.3.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Input:</span> </span></span><math id="algorithm2.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathrm{final\_answer}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>final</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>_</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>answer</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathrm{final\_answer}</annotation></semantics></math>: model’s predicted answer
</div>
<div id="algorithm2.4.4" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="algorithm2.4.4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_phantom"><span style="visibility:hidden"><span id="algorithm2.4.4.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Input:</span> </span></span><math id="algorithm2.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="d" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>d</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">d</annotation></semantics></math>: position offset (<math id="algorithm2.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="d{=}1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">d{=}1</annotation></semantics></math> for Coconut, <math id="algorithm2.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="d{=}2" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">d{=}2</annotation></semantics></math> for CODI)
</div>
<div id="algorithm2.4.5" class="ltx_listingline"><span id="algorithm2.4.5.1" class="ltx_text"><span id="algorithm2.4.5.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Output:</span> </span>Computation tree and verification status
</div>
<div id="algorithm2.4.6" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algorithm2.4.6.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">1</span></span>
            <span id="algorithm2.4.6.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span> <em id="algorithm2.4.6.3" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic"><math id="algorithm2.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathrm{pos}\leftarrow 0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>pos</mi><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathrm{pos}\leftarrow 0</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="algorithm2.4.6.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold ltx_font_upright">to</span> <math id="algorithm2.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathrm{num\_latent\_positions}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>num</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">_</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>latent</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">_</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>positions</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathrm{num\_latent\_positions}</annotation></semantics></math></em> <span id="algorithm2.4.6.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">do</span>  <span id="algorithm2.4.6.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">// </span><span id="algorithm2.4.6.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">Phase 1: Generate candidate steps</span>
</div>
<div id="algorithm2.4.7" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> 
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algorithm2.4.7.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">2</span></span>
            <math id="algorithm2.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\textit{result}\leftarrow\text{top-1 integer at }V[\mathrm{pos}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">result</mtext><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mtext>top-1 integer at </mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>V</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>pos</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\textit{result}\leftarrow\text{top-1 integer at }V[\mathrm{pos}]</annotation></semantics></math>;
</div>
<div id="algorithm2.4.8" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> 
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algorithm2.4.8.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">3</span></span>
            <span id="algorithm2.4.8.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">if</span> <em id="algorithm2.4.8.3" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic"><span id="algorithm2.4.8.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_markedasmath">result</span> is None</em> <span id="algorithm2.4.8.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">then</span> <span id="algorithm2.4.8.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">continue</span>;
</div>
<div id="algorithm2.4.9" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> 
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algorithm2.4.9.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">4</span></span>
            <math id="algorithm2.m12" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\textit{operands}\leftarrow\mathrm{top\text{-}}k\text{ integers at }V[\mathrm{pos}-d]\;\cup\;\{\text{top-1 integer at position }p:p&lt;\mathrm{pos}\}\;\cup\;Q" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">operands</mtext><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>top</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mtext>-</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>k</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mtext> integers at </mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>V</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mi>pos</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow><mo rspace="0.280em" stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="0.502em">∪</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mtext>top-1 integer at position </mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>p</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0.278em" rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>pos</mi></mrow><mo rspace="0.280em" stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><mo rspace="0.502em">∪</mo><mi>Q</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\textit{operands}\leftarrow\mathrm{top\text{-}}k\text{ integers at }V[\mathrm{pos}-d]\;\cup\;\{\text{top-1 integer at position }p:p&lt;\mathrm{pos}\}\;\cup\;Q</annotation></semantics></math>;
</div>
<div id="algorithm2.4.10" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> 
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algorithm2.4.10.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">5</span></span>
            <math id="algorithm2.m13" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="S_{2}\leftarrow\{(a,b,\mathrm{op},\textit{result}):a,b\in\textit{operands},\;a\;\mathrm{op}\;b=\textit{result},\;\mathrm{op}\in\{+,-,\times,\div\}\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>op</mi><mo>,</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">result</mtext><mo rspace="0.278em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>∈</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">operands</mtext><mo rspace="0.447em">,</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>op</mi><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">result</mtext><mo rspace="0.447em">,</mo><mi>op</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">+</mo><mo rspace="0em">,</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">−</mo><mo rspace="0em">,</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">×</mo><mo rspace="0em">,</mo><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">÷</mo><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">S_{2}\leftarrow\{(a,b,\mathrm{op},\textit{result}):a,b\in\textit{operands},\;a\;\mathrm{op}\;b=\textit{result},\;\mathrm{op}\in\{+,-,\times,\div\}\}</annotation></semantics></math>;
</div>
<div id="algorithm2.4.11" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> 
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algorithm2.4.11.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">6</span></span>
            <math id="algorithm2.m14" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="S_{3}\leftarrow\{(a,b,c,\mathrm{op}_{1},\mathrm{op}_{2},\textit{result}):a,b,c\in\textit{operands},\;a\;\mathrm{op}_{1}\;b\;\mathrm{op}_{2}\;c=\textit{result}\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>op</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>op</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">result</mtext><mo rspace="0.278em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>∈</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">operands</mtext><mo rspace="0.447em">,</mo><mi>a</mi><msub><mi>op</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mi>b</mi><msub><mi>op</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">result</mtext><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">S_{3}\leftarrow\{(a,b,c,\mathrm{op}_{1},\mathrm{op}_{2},\textit{result}):a,b,c\in\textit{operands},\;a\;\mathrm{op}_{1}\;b\;\mathrm{op}_{2}\;c=\textit{result}\}</annotation></semantics></math>;
</div>
<div id="algorithm2.4.12" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> 
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algorithm2.4.12.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">7</span></span>
            <math id="algorithm2.m15" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\textit{steps}\leftarrow S_{2}\cup S_{3}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">steps</mtext><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>∪</mo><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\textit{steps}\leftarrow S_{2}\cup S_{3}</annotation></semantics></math>;
</div>
<div id="algorithm2.4.13" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> <span id="algorithm2.4.13.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">// </span><span id="algorithm2.4.13.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">Prioritize by: (1) operand source: verified intermediate <math id="algorithm2.m16" class="ltx_Math" alttext="&gt;" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>&gt;</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">&gt;</annotation></semantics></math> question number <math id="algorithm2.m17" class="ltx_Math" alttext="&gt;" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>&gt;</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">&gt;</annotation></semantics></math> top-<math id="algorithm2.m18" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>k</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k</annotation></semantics></math> <math id="algorithm2.m19" class="ltx_Math" alttext="&gt;" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>&gt;</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">&gt;</annotation></semantics></math> unverified intermediate, (2) fewer operands </span>
</div>
<div id="algorithm2.4.14" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> 
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algorithm2.4.14.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">8</span></span>
            <math id="algorithm2.m20" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\textit{candidates}\leftarrow\mathrm{sort}(\textit{steps},\text{by priority above})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">candidates</mtext><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mi>sort</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">steps</mtext><mo>,</mo><mtext>by priority above</mtext><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\textit{candidates}\leftarrow\mathrm{sort}(\textit{steps},\text{by priority above})</annotation></semantics></math>;
</div>
<div id="algorithm2.4.15" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> 
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algorithm2.4.15.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">9</span></span>
            <math id="algorithm2.m21" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\textit{best}\leftarrow\mathrm{None}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">best</mtext><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mi>None</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\textit{best}\leftarrow\mathrm{None}</annotation></semantics></math>;
</div>
<div id="algorithm2.4.16" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> 
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algorithm2.4.16.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">10</span></span>
            <span id="algorithm2.4.16.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">foreach</span> <em id="algorithm2.4.16.3" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic"><math id="algorithm2.m22" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\textit{candidate}\in\textit{candidates}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">candidate</mtext><mo>∈</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">candidates</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\textit{candidate}\in\textit{candidates}</annotation></semantics></math></em> <span id="algorithm2.4.16.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">do</span>  <span id="algorithm2.4.16.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">// </span><span id="algorithm2.4.16.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">Phase 2: Try to verify one candidate step</span>
</div>
<div id="algorithm2.4.17" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span>  <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> 
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algorithm2.4.17.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">11</span></span>
            <span id="algorithm2.4.17.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">if</span> <em id="algorithm2.4.17.3" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic"><math id="algorithm2.m23" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\textsc{Verify}(\textit{candidate},\,n_{\mathrm{attempts}},\,r_{\mathrm{passes}})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mtext class="ltx_font_smallcaps">Verify</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">candidate</mtext><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>attempts</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>passes</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\textsc{Verify}(\textit{candidate},\,n_{\mathrm{attempts}},\,r_{\mathrm{passes}})</annotation></semantics></math></em> <span id="algorithm2.4.17.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">then</span>
</div>
<div id="algorithm2.4.18" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span>  <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span>  <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> 
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algorithm2.4.18.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">12</span></span>
            <math id="algorithm2.m24" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\textit{best}\leftarrow\textit{candidate}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">best</mtext><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">candidate</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\textit{best}\leftarrow\textit{candidate}</annotation></semantics></math>;
</div>
<div id="algorithm2.4.19" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span>  <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span>  <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> 
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algorithm2.4.19.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">13</span></span>
            <span id="algorithm2.4.19.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">break</span>;
</div>
<div id="algorithm2.4.20" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span>  <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> 
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algorithm2.4.20.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">14</span></span>
            end if
</div>
<div id="algorithm2.4.21" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> 
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algorithm2.4.21.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">15</span></span>
            end foreach
</div>
<div id="algorithm2.4.22" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> 
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algorithm2.4.22.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">16</span></span>
            <span id="algorithm2.4.22.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">if</span> <em id="algorithm2.4.22.3" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic"><math id="algorithm2.m25" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\textit{best}=\mathrm{None}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">best</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>None</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\textit{best}=\mathrm{None}</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="algorithm2.4.22.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">and</span> <math id="algorithm2.m26" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\textit{candidates}\neq\emptyset" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">candidates</mtext><mo>≠</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">∅</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\textit{candidates}\neq\emptyset</annotation></semantics></math></em> <span id="algorithm2.4.22.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">then</span> <math id="algorithm2.m27" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\textit{best}\leftarrow\textit{candidates}[0]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">best</mtext><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">candidates</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\textit{best}\leftarrow\textit{candidates}[0]</annotation></semantics></math>;
</div>
<div id="algorithm2.4.23" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algorithm2.4.23.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">17</span></span>
            end for
</div>
<div id="algorithm2.4.24" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algorithm2.4.24.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">18</span></span>
            <math id="algorithm2.m28" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\textit{root}\leftarrow\text{earliest step where }\textit{result}=\mathrm{final\_answer}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">root</mtext><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mtext>earliest step where </mtext><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">result</mtext></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mi>final</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>_</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>answer</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\textit{root}\leftarrow\text{earliest step where }\textit{result}=\mathrm{final\_answer}</annotation></semantics></math> ;  <span id="algorithm2.4.24.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">// </span><span id="algorithm2.4.24.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">Phase 3: Build reasoning trace</span>
</div>
<div id="algorithm2.4.25" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algorithm2.4.25.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">19</span></span>
            <math id="algorithm2.m29" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\textit{tree\_steps}\leftarrow\{\textit{root}\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">tree_steps</mtext><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">root</mtext><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\textit{tree\_steps}\leftarrow\{\textit{root}\}</annotation></semantics></math>;
</div>
<div id="algorithm2.4.26" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algorithm2.4.26.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">20</span></span>
            <span id="algorithm2.4.26.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">foreach</span> <em id="algorithm2.4.26.3" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">step <math id="algorithm2.m30" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\in" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>∈</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\in</annotation></semantics></math> tree_steps</em> <span id="algorithm2.4.26.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">do</span>
</div>
<div id="algorithm2.4.27" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> 
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algorithm2.4.27.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">21</span></span>
            <span id="algorithm2.4.27.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">foreach</span> <em id="algorithm2.4.27.3" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">operand <math id="algorithm2.m31" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\in" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>∈</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\in</annotation></semantics></math> step</em> <span id="algorithm2.4.27.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">do</span>
</div>
<div id="algorithm2.4.28" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span>  <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> 
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algorithm2.4.28.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">22</span></span>
            <span id="algorithm2.4.28.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">if</span> <em id="algorithm2.4.28.3" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">operand came from a previous step’s result</em> <span id="algorithm2.4.28.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">then</span>
</div>
<div id="algorithm2.4.29" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span>  <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span>  <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> 
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algorithm2.4.29.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">23</span></span>
            <math id="algorithm2.m32" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\textit{tree\_steps}\leftarrow\textit{tree\_steps}\,\cup\,\{\textit{source\_step}\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">tree_steps</mtext><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">tree_steps</mtext><mo lspace="0.392em" rspace="0.392em">∪</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">source_step</mtext><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\textit{tree\_steps}\leftarrow\textit{tree\_steps}\,\cup\,\{\textit{source\_step}\}</annotation></semantics></math>;
</div>
<div id="algorithm2.4.30" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span>  <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> 
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algorithm2.4.30.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">24</span></span>
            end if
</div>
<div id="algorithm2.4.31" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> 
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algorithm2.4.31.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">25</span></span>
            end foreach
</div>
<div id="algorithm2.4.32" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algorithm2.4.32.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">26</span></span>
            end foreach
</div>
<div id="algorithm2.4.33" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algorithm2.4.33.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">27</span></span>
            <math id="algorithm2.m33" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\textit{tree\_verified}\leftarrow\mathrm{all}(\textit{step.verified}\text{ for }\textit{step}\in\textit{tree\_steps})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">tree_verified</mtext><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mi>all</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">step.verified</mtext><mtext> for </mtext><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">step</mtext></mrow><mo>∈</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">tree_steps</mtext></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\textit{tree\_verified}\leftarrow\mathrm{all}(\textit{step.verified}\text{ for }\textit{step}\in\textit{tree\_steps})</annotation></semantics></math>;
</div>
<div id="algorithm2.4.34" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algorithm2.4.34.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">28</span></span>
            <span id="algorithm2.4.34.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">return</span> <span id="algorithm2.4.34.3" class="ltx_text ltx_markedasmath ltx_font_italic">tree_steps</span> sorted by position, <span id="algorithm2.4.34.4" class="ltx_text ltx_markedasmath ltx_font_italic">tree_verified</span>;
</div>
<div id="algorithm2.4.35" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algorithm2.4.35.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">29</span></span>
            
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algorithm2.4.35.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">30</span></span>
            <span id="algorithm2.4.35.3" class="ltx_text ltx_leader"><span class="ltx_rule" style="width:100%;height:1px;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span></span>
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algorithm2.4.35.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">31</span></span>
            
</div>
<div id="algorithm2.4.36" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algorithm2.4.36.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">32</span></span>
            <span id="algorithm2.4.36.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Function</span> <em id="algorithm2.4.36.3" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_smallcaps">Verify<math id="algorithm2.m36" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(\textit{step},\,n_{\mathrm{attempts}},\,r_{\mathrm{passes}})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">step</mtext><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>attempts</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>passes</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(\textit{step},\,n_{\mathrm{attempts}},\,r_{\mathrm{passes}})</annotation></semantics></math></em><span id="algorithm2.4.36.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">:</span>
</div>
<div id="algorithm2.4.37" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> 
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algorithm2.4.37.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">33</span></span>
            <math id="algorithm2.m37" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\textit{pass\_count}\leftarrow 0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">pass_count</mtext><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\textit{pass\_count}\leftarrow 0</annotation></semantics></math>;
</div>
<div id="algorithm2.4.38" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> 
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algorithm2.4.38.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">34</span></span>
            <span id="algorithm2.4.38.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span> <em id="algorithm2.4.38.3" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic"><math id="algorithm2.m38" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i\leftarrow 1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i\leftarrow 1</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="algorithm2.4.38.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold ltx_font_upright">to</span> <math id="algorithm2.m39" class="ltx_Math" alttext="n_{\mathrm{attempts}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>attempts</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">n_{\mathrm{attempts}}</annotation></semantics></math></em> <span id="algorithm2.4.38.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">do</span>
</div>
<div id="algorithm2.4.39" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span>  <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> 
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algorithm2.4.39.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">35</span></span>
            <math id="algorithm2.m40" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\textit{var}\leftarrow\text{select operand traceable to question}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">var</mtext><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mtext>select operand traceable to question</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\textit{var}\leftarrow\text{select operand traceable to question}</annotation></semantics></math>;
</div>
<div id="algorithm2.4.40" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span>  <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> 
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algorithm2.4.40.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">36</span></span>
            <math id="algorithm2.m41" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\textit{new\_val}\leftarrow\text{sample different single-token integer}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">new_val</mtext><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mtext>sample different single-token integer</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\textit{new\_val}\leftarrow\text{sample different single-token integer}</annotation></semantics></math>;
</div>
<div id="algorithm2.4.41" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span>  <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> 
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algorithm2.4.41.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">37</span></span>
            <math id="algorithm2.m42" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\textit{expected}\leftarrow\text{recompute step result with }\textit{new\_val}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">expected</mtext><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mtext>recompute step result with </mtext><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">new_val</mtext></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\textit{expected}\leftarrow\text{recompute step result with }\textit{new\_val}</annotation></semantics></math>;
</div>
<div id="algorithm2.4.42" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span>  <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> 
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algorithm2.4.42.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">38</span></span>
            <math id="algorithm2.m43" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\textit{observed}\leftarrow\text{top-1 integer at }V^{\prime}[\textit{step.position}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">observed</mtext><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mtext>top-1 integer at </mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>V</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">step.position</mtext><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\textit{observed}\leftarrow\text{top-1 integer at }V^{\prime}[\textit{step.position}]</annotation></semantics></math> ;  <span id="algorithm2.4.42.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">// </span><math id="algorithm2.m44" class="ltx_Math" alttext="V^{\prime}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi>V</mi><mo>′</mo></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">V^{\prime}</annotation></semantics></math><span id="algorithm2.4.42.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter"> from modified prompt</span>
</div>
<div id="algorithm2.4.43" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span>  <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> 
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algorithm2.4.43.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">39</span></span>
            <span id="algorithm2.4.43.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">if</span> <em id="algorithm2.4.43.3" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic"><math id="algorithm2.m45" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\textit{observed}=\textit{expected}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">observed</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">expected</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\textit{observed}=\textit{expected}</annotation></semantics></math></em> <span id="algorithm2.4.43.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">then</span> <math id="algorithm2.m46" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\textit{pass\_count}\leftarrow\textit{pass\_count}+1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">pass_count</mtext><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">pass_count</mtext><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\textit{pass\_count}\leftarrow\textit{pass\_count}+1</annotation></semantics></math>;
</div>
<div id="algorithm2.4.44" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> 
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algorithm2.4.44.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">40</span></span>
            end for
</div>
<div id="algorithm2.4.45" class="ltx_listingline"> <span class="ltx_rule" style="width:1px;height:100%;--ltx-bg-color:black;display:inline-block;"> </span> 
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="algorithm2.4.45.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">41</span></span>
            <span id="algorithm2.4.45.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">return</span> <math id="algorithm2.m47" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\textit{pass\_count}\geq r_{\mathrm{passes}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_italic">pass_count</mtext><mo>≥</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>passes</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\textit{pass\_count}\geq r_{\mathrm{passes}}</annotation></semantics></math>;
</div>
<div id="algorithm2.4.46" class="ltx_listingline">
</div>
</div>
</figure>
<div class="ltx_pagination ltx_role_newpage"></div>
</section>
<section id="A9.SS2" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">I.2 </span>Forward chaining verification example</h3>

<div id="A9.SS2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A9.SS2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">This section contains an example of how the forward chaining method works. <a href="#A9.F15" title="Figure 15 ‣ I.2 Forward chaining verification example ‣ Appendix I Forward chaining experiment ‣ Are Latent Reasoning Models Easily Interpretable?" class="ltx_ref ltx_refmacro_autoref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Figure 15</span></a> shows a found and verified reasoning trace, which happens to be the same as the gold reasoning trace for this instance. First, we generate candidate steps that may be encoded for each latent token. Latent token 0 has no candidate steps: it has no integer tokens in its top-10 vocabulary projection, so there is no step result. Latent token 1 also has no candidate steps. Its top integer token is 39, but there’s no arithmetic combination of candidate operands that can combine to produce it.</p>
</div>
<div id="A9.SS2.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A9.SS2.p2.1" class="ltx_p">Latent token 2’s top integer token is 17, so we assume that is the result produced by the encoded step. There are two candidate steps that the model may be using to get 17: <math id="A9.SS2.p2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="5+22-10=17" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>22</mn></mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>17</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">5+22-10=17</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A9.SS2.p2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="22-5=17" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>22</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>17</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">22-5=17</annotation></semantics></math>. The first candidate step passes 1 out of 3 verification attempts, as shown in <a href="#A9.F16" title="Figure 16 ‣ I.2 Forward chaining verification example ‣ Appendix I Forward chaining experiment ‣ Are Latent Reasoning Models Easily Interpretable?" class="ltx_ref ltx_refmacro_autoref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Figure 16</span></a>. The second candidate step passes 3 out of 3 verification attempts, as shown in <a href="#A9.F17" title="Figure 17 ‣ I.2 Forward chaining verification example ‣ Appendix I Forward chaining experiment ‣ Are Latent Reasoning Models Easily Interpretable?" class="ltx_ref ltx_refmacro_autoref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Figure 17</span></a>.</p>
</div>
<div id="A9.SS2.p3" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A9.SS2.p3.1" class="ltx_p">The process continues for the remaining latent tokens and the answer position. It verifies the step <math id="A9.SS2.p3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="22+17=39" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>22</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>17</mn></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>39</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">22+17=39</annotation></semantics></math> at latent token 4 with 3 out of 3 verification attempts passing, and <math id="A9.SS2.p3.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="39*10=390" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>39</mn><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">∗</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>390</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">39*10=390</annotation></semantics></math> at the answer position with 2 out of 3 verification attempts passing. The forward chaining method then assembles the found steps into the full reasoning trace: <math id="A9.SS2.p3.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="22-5=17" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>22</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>17</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">22-5=17</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="A9.SS2.p3.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="22+17=39" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>22</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>17</mn></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>39</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">22+17=39</annotation></semantics></math>, and <math id="A9.SS2.p3.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="10*39=390" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn>10</mn><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">∗</mo><mn>39</mn></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>390</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">10*39=390</annotation></semantics></math>. This reasoning trace is considered verified for 1 or 2 required passes, and unverified for 3 required passes.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A9.F15" class="ltx_figure"><object type="image/svg+xml" data="2604.04902v1/vp_table_sample_290_codi_llama.svg" id="A9.F15.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:548/182;" width="548" height="182"></object>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 15: </span>CODI + Llama-3.2-1B-Instruct’s vocabulary projections, from instance 290 of GSM8k-Aug’s test split. The reasoning trace found and verified by the forward chaining method is displayed. This reasoning trace happens to match the gold reasoning trace.</figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="A9.F16" class="ltx_figure"><object type="image/svg+xml" data="2604.04902v1/sample_290_codi_llama_LT2_candidate1.svg" id="A9.F16.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_portrait" style="aspect-ratio:548/686;" width="548" height="686"></object>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 16: </span>Verification process for latent token 2, candidate step 1 from instance 290 of GSM8k-Aug’s test split.</figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="A9.F17" class="ltx_figure"><object type="image/svg+xml" data="2604.04902v1/sample_290_codi_llama_LT2_candidate2.svg" id="A9.F17.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_portrait" style="aspect-ratio:548/686;" width="548" height="686"></object>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 17: </span>Verification process for latent token 2, candidate step 2 from instance 290 of GSM8k-Aug’s test split.</figcaption>
</figure>
<div class="ltx_pagination ltx_role_newpage"></div>
</section>
<section id="A9.SS3" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">I.3 </span>Dataset requirements for the forward chaining method</h3>

<div id="A9.SS3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A9.SS3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The forward chaining method described in <a href="#S6" title="6 Can we extract reasoning traces in latent tokens without supervision? ‣ Are Latent Reasoning Models Easily Interpretable?" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Section</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">6</span></a> will work with a dataset that meets the following requirements:</p>
</div>
<div id="A9.SS3.p2" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<ol id="A9.I1" class="ltx_enumerate">
<li id="A9.I1.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">1.</span> 
<div id="A9.I1.i1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A9.I1.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The reasoning trace must be decomposable into steps.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A9.I1.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">2.</span> 
<div id="A9.I1.i2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A9.I1.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Each step must be a deterministic function of its operands and produce one result.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A9.I1.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">3.</span> 
<div id="A9.I1.i3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A9.I1.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The operators must be a known, small set so that forward chaining can brute-force search over them.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A9.I1.i4" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">4.</span> 
<div id="A9.I1.i4.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A9.I1.i4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The operands and results must be single-token, so that they can be observed using vocabulary projection. Note that this is also a function of the tokenizer used.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A9.I1.i5" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">5.</span> 
<div id="A9.I1.i5.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A9.I1.i5.p1.1" class="ltx_p">For each step, at least one base operand must be mentioned in the prompt. The base operands are just the step operands, or, if one of the operands is the result of a previous step, then the base operands can be the base operands of that previous step. A reasoning step cannot be fully based on operands from its world knowledge. If no base operands are mentioned in the prompt, then this method cannot verify the step by modifying the prompt.</p>
</div></li>
<li id="A9.I1.i6" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">6.</span> 
<div id="A9.I1.i6.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A9.I1.i6.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The base operands and step results must be distinguishable from each other. This makes it unambiguous which base operand mentioned in the prompt should be modified to verify a given step.</p>
</div></li>
</ol>
</div>
<div id="A9.SS3.p3" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A9.SS3.p3.1" class="ltx_p">Requirement 3 can be removed if future work finds a way to detect the operator used from the model’s representations directly. In our experiments, we found that the LRMs studied do not encode the operators in the latent tokens, at least not in a way that is detectable using vocabulary projection. Since there are only four operators used in GSM8k-Aug, we brute-force search over them.</p>
</div>
<div id="A9.SS3.p4" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A9.SS3.p4.1" class="ltx_p">Datasets can be modified to meet requirement 4 by replacing key multi-token concepts with single-token concepts. Alternatively, future work could use a method other than vocabulary projection for detecting concepts encoded in a latent token, which would allow for multi-token operands and intermediate results.</p>
</div>
<div id="A9.SS3.p5" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A9.SS3.p5.1" class="ltx_p">Requirement 6 makes this method difficult to use for tasks that have a small set of possible operands or results, which make it likely for multiple steps to have the same intermediate result. E.g., the step results in logical reasoning tasks may be only “True” or “False.”</p>
</div>
<div class="ltx_pagination ltx_role_newpage"></div>
</section>
</section>
<section id="A10" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix J </span>PrOntoQA heuristic</h2>

<div id="A10.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A10.p1.1" class="ltx_p">During our investigation into how models solve PrOntoQA, we noticed that all instances from this dataset can be solved by treating the problem as a directed acyclic graph and continually exploring the child node with the most children nodes until you arrive at the node with the property in question. This can be implemented as a counting task for the child node that is mentioned the most in the prompt. E.g., for the problem in <a href="#A10.F18" title="Figure 18 ‣ Appendix J PrOntoQA heuristic ‣ Are Latent Reasoning Models Easily Interpretable?" class="ltx_ref ltx_refmacro_autoref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Figure 18</span></a>, starting at the start node named “Max”, there are two choices of child nodes: vumpus and lorpus. Vumpus has two children, and lorpus has one. Since vumpus has more children, it is also mentioned more frequently in the promt than lorpus. You can keep going down the graph in the same manner until numpus is reached, which has the property in question of “not wooden”. Since all instances of PrOntoQA can be solved in this way, it’s possible for models to exploit this heuristic instead of learning to search or do first-order logical reasoning.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A10.F18" class="ltx_figure"><object type="image/svg+xml" data="2604.04902v1/prontoqa_train_1.svg" id="A10.F18.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_square" style="aspect-ratio:548/498;" width="548" height="498"></object>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 18: </span>Instance 1 of the train split of PrOntoQA shown as a directed acyclic graph. This instance is also shown in text in <a href="#A2.F8" title="Figure 8 ‣ Appendix B Dataset details ‣ Are Latent Reasoning Models Easily Interpretable?" class="ltx_ref ltx_refmacro_autoref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Figure 8</span></a>.</figcaption>
</figure>
</section>
</article>
